      "writtenOn": "2026-03-26T23:23:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit that you\u0027re free to ignore: This feels a little weird, as it\u0027s effectively a descriptor with the create method on the descriptor itself? It works, but it seems to go against the patterns used in the rest of Dawn.\n\nWould it be too confusing to put the CreateSampler method on the Sampler object at the top of the file?",
